    {
      "text": "Planning Commission staff report (2024-09-10): demolish a 1953 house, ADU and outbuildings on a 1.03-acre parcel and build 10 townhome-style single-family attached duet units, each about 2,500 sq ft, two stories, three bedrooms, with a two-car garage; density 9.71 units per acre; General Plan and zoning Residential Attached Low (RAL 3,500); 27 trees removed and 47 planted; CEQA Class 32 infill exemption; project also called Borello Orchards.",
